# Compiled programs and test binaries (e.g. from `go build` or `go test -c`)
*.exe
*.test
/bin/

# Coverage reports (from `go test -coverprofile=coverage.out ./...`)
coverage.out
coverage.html
*.coverprofile

# Note: Go keeps its build and test caches outside the project
# (see `go env GOCACHE`), so there is no cache folder to ignore here.
